# LeakSanitizer suppressions for external OS and graphics/crypto driver libraries:
# - libp11-kit: glibc newlocale allocation in library constructor
# - libvulkan/libGLX/libX11: persistent X11/Vulkan loader driver registrations
# - __pthread_once_slow / ___pthread_once: dlclose()'d Mesa/Vulkan driver thread-once tables reported as <unknown module>
leak:libp11-kit
leak:libvulkan
leak:libGLX
leak:libX11
leak:__pthread_once_slow
leak:___pthread_once

